.DS_Store
*.log
*.bak
*.orig
*.swp
*.tmp
*.pem
*.p7b
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# HarmonyOS / local tool generated files
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
native/rust_signer/target/
# hdc_transport 是独立的 cargo 工程，先前的规则只覆盖了 rust_signer，
# 结果它的构建产物被 git add -A 带了进来（989 个文件 / 150MB）。
native/hdc_transport/**/target/
**/.hvigor/
**/oh_modules/
**/.ohpm/
**/node_modules/
**/local.properties
**/.metadata
**/.cxx/

# 构建产物：Rust 的 target/ 会到几百 MB，误提交一次就永久留在历史里
**/target/

# Release assets belong in Releases, not the source tree.
*.hap
*.app
*.hsp
*.har
*.so
*.a
dist/

# Local evidence, design experiments, administration client and operations.
# Required runtime resources, source archives and licenses stay tracked.
/docs/
/design/
/monitor/
/.local/
/tmpFile*
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
